# Local-only release/runtime state and test output. None of these are Vercel
# build inputs (the build runs `prisma generate && next build`; the release
# fingerprint is computed from git state, not from artifacts/). artifacts/
# in particular is written continuously by the mac-mini launchd runtime
# (canonical-root.json.tmp.* etc.), so including it in `vercel deploy
# --archive=tgz` races the tar against live temp-file churn → ENOENT.
artifacts/
test-results/
playwright-report/
